  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a1f35d17cb7cd32f",
      "translationZh": "我的深入研究和理解表明，这个项目是无与伦比的，它是一个自成一体的领域，并非为了取代任何东西，而是对大多数消费者/中小企业构建方案的补充。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2983d4ae09c83e64",
      "translationZh": "LexiPanel 是我用于本地 AI 的自托管控制平面。我构建它是因为我希望机器本身是可理解、可衡量且可调优的，而不是将一切隐藏在预设之后。是的，它带有浓厚的“氛围编程”色彩，以我孩子的名字“Panel”命名，而且我最初是为自己的家庭实验室构建它的。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "301e660dacacd120",
      "translationZh": "现在的核心理念很简单：让 AI 适配硬件和工作负载，而不仅仅是直接启动它。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "28beb6b8f42eb47c",
      "translationZh": "通过一个浏览器运行多个独立的 llama.cpp、stable-diffusion.cpp、audio.cpp、Camelid 和 ONNX Runtime 实例",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "8eeae8a55a413d5b",
      "translationZh": "支持 CPU/GPU/NPU，包括针对 AMD Ryzen AI、Intel 和 Qualcomm NPU 的 ONNX 路径",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "3218cd733748cb14",
      "translationZh": "220 多个解释过的控制选项，以及对当前 llama.cpp 构建版本所暴露标志的透传访问权限",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "1f43b574c55f26ee",
      "translationZh": "在启动前显示确切的启动命令/环境变量、警告、VRAM/RAM 预估值以及拒绝原因",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "79e7244ca50763b9",
      "translationZh": "读取 GGUF 元数据，考虑已存在的运行中工作负载，并防止不安全的启动",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e3e2e4e81e593f19",
      "translationZh": "衡量长上下文解码行为，而不是将单一的 tok/s 数值视为全部情况",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "9b225c22cb4f585f",
      "translationZh": "对编程和智能体工作负载进行基准测试，并将配置/模型与您实际运行的工作负载进行对比",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "0979fccabde4b5f1",
      "translationZh": "Auto-fit 会学习空闲窗口，测试安全变更，将其与后续真实流量进行对比，并回滚性能退化",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a712a1d26545c178",
      "translationZh": "Fit 可以在您的实际显卡上对量化格式进行基准测试，根据真实的显存预算创建张量级重量化方案，进行构建并验证结果",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "1c333e0da40c7ab1",
      "translationZh": "GPU 调优会测量速度、热量、功耗和 tokens/joule。支持的 AMD 调优可以自动还原不稳定的设置",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
