      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "3a49650a3aa0c6e3",
      "translationZh": "Graph Gauntlet 依然存在，因为盯着图表看也会腻",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "52a668365481c0fb",
      "translationZh": "后端依然刻意保持简单：仅使用 Python 标准库，没有 pip 应用依赖，没有 Docker，没有数据库，没有前端构建系统。状态即文件 + systemd。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "59c76726e2e70bfc",
      "translationZh": "我认为不同之处在于这个循环：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "88dff3587ca4e327",
      "translationZh": "发现 → 拟合 → 优化 → 验证 → 运行 → 学习 → 适应",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "57d8db6addc682cb",
      "translationZh": "它并不试图取代 Open WebUI、Ollama、GPUStack、LocalAI、vLLM 等工具。其目标是作为应用程序和智能体（agents）的底层支撑，使本地 AI 设备或小型异构集群能够尽可能安全、透明地发挥硬件性能。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "876a07056eef595a",
